<title>AUSTRIA: Austria May c/a deficit widens to 10.1 bln ats.</title>
<headline>Austria May c/a deficit widens to 10.1 bln ats.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank reported the following economic indicator details. (In billions of schillings)</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN CURRENT ACCOUNT	MAY	  APRIL   MAY 96</p>
<p> Current account balance	-10.1	  -3.4    -12.4</p>
<p> Merchandise trade balance     -6.6	  -4.2     -8.7</p>
<p> Exports			     69.1	  78.2     61.5</p>
<p> Imports			     75.7	  82.4     70.2</p>
<p>CUMULATIVE FIGURES (January to month in question)</p>
<p> Current account balance	-21.4	  -11.4   -17.0</p>
<p> Merchandise trade balance    -35.6	  -29.1   -35.1</p>
<p> Exports			    328.6	  259.4   306.5</p>
<p> Imports			    364.2	  288.5   341.7</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12256</p>
</text>
